          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">We source premium hardwoods and match species to each commission for beautiful durability.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
