          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Each project is built with care for a limited number of clients each season.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-slate-400">Thoughtful Finish</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Finishes are selected to bring out wood tone, texture, and long-term resilience.</p>
